
                                                  CONFIG CLEAN COMMAND


Config clean command implements the clean functionality.

-----------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SWITCHES               |    DESCRIPTION
-----------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   -in_t               |    Template input XML file.
   -cleanin            |    Clean Input XML file.
   -rule_t             |    Template rules XML file.
   -cleanrule          |    Clean rule Input XML file.
   -out_t              |    Template output XML file.
   -clean_out          |    Clean Output XML file.
   -clean_t            |    Template Clean XML file.
   -clean              |    Clean Input XML file.
   -hex                |    Input HEX file.
   -cleanhex           |    Clean Input HEX file.
   -hexmod18           |    To identify it is MDG1 project.
   -hexmod_clean_log   |    Hexmod clean Log file.
   -hexmod18           |    To identify it is MDG1 project.   
-----------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Example:

--rule_t      _gen/swb/module/hexmod/RULES.XT
--in_t        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INPUT.XT
--out_t       _gen/swb/module/hexmod/OUTPUT.XT
--clean_t             _gen/swb/module/hexmod/CLEANUP.XT
--core_exp    _gen/swb/module/coreproc/filelist_gen_merged_exp.txt
--prj_adx      _gen/swb/module/asap2/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE.adx
--all_hex     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/all_hex_files.lst
--prj_hex     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE_src.hex
--hex         _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE_tmp.hex
--hexmod18    
--lyt          0x20
--cleanin             _gen/swb/module/hexmod/clean_input.xml
--clean               _gen/swb/module/hexmod/clean.xml
--hexmod_log   _log/swb/module/hexmod/hexmod_merge.log
--logfile      _log/swb/module/hexmod/config_hexmod_merge.log
--clean_out              _gen/swb/module/hexmod/clean_output.xml
--hexmod_clean_log	_log/swb/module/hexmod/hexmod_clean.log
--cleanrule	_gen/swb/module/hexmod/cleanRule.xml
--cleanhex         _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MMD104VMAC1483_N6A0_CORETASK0_cleaned_otp.hex

